{"text":"Was sind objektive Signale, dass es in die richtige Richtung geht? Vier Dinge, an denen du dich orientieren kannst. Signal eins: Du machst Dinge im Alltag, die früher schwer oder unmöglich waren. Funktionelle Erweiterung. Signal zwei: Flares werden seltener, kürzer oder weniger intensiv. Selbst wenn sie immer noch passieren – sie reichen weniger weit. Signal drei: Du erholst dich schneller von Belastungs-Spitzen. Wo früher ein Tag Recovery brauchte, brauchst du jetzt ein paar Stunden. Signal vier: Du fühlst dich mental anders mit deinem Schmerz. Weniger Angst, weniger Ohnmacht, mehr Vertrauen ins eigene System. Das ist das wichtigste Signal überhaupt – und das schwierigste in Worte zu fassen. Wenn diese vier Signale auftauchen, läuft dein System. Selbst wenn dein Schmerz an bestimmten Tagen schwankt – diese vier Trends sind das, was zählt.","chars":["W","a","s"," ","s","i","n","d"," ","o","b","j","e","k","t","i","v","e"," ","S","i","g","n","a","l","e",","," ","d","a","s","s"," ","e","s"," ","i","n"," ","d","i","e"," ","r","i","c","h","t","i","g","e"," ","R","i","c","h","t","u","n","g"," ","g","e","h","t","?"," ","V","i","e","r"," ","D","i","n","g","e",","," ","a","n"," ","d","e","n","e","n"," ","d","u"," ","d","i","c","h"," ","o","r","i","e","n","t","i","e","r","e","n"," ","k","a","n","n","s","t","."," ","S","i","g","n","a","l"," ","e","i","n","s",":"," ","D","u"," ","m","a","c","h","s","t"," ","D","i","n","g","e"," ","i","m"," ","A","l","l","t","a","g",","," ","d","i","e"," ","f","r","ü","h","e","r"," ","s","c","h","w","e","r"," ","o","d","e","r"," ","u","n","m","ö","g","l","i","c","h"," ","w","a","r","e","n","."," ","F","u","n","k","t","i","o","n","e","l","l","e"," ","E","r","w","e","i","t","e","r","u","n","g","."," ","S","i","g","n","a","l"," ","z","w","e","i",":"," ","F","l","a","r","e","s"," ","w","e","r","d","e","n"," ","s","e","l","t","e","n","e","r",","," ","k","ü","r","z","e","r"," ","o","d","e","r"," ","w","e","n","i","g","e","r"," ","i","n","t","